"NanoVG controls use vector-style painting while retaining the same UI tree, layout, focus, and behavior foundations. NanoNode defines the painting contract; NanoContainer and concrete controls provide panels, labels, buttons, images, fields, sliders, combo boxes, links, and scrollable content.","VECTOR PAINTING  ·  SHARED INTERACTION  ·  MEASUREMENT  ·  MIXED TREES","NanoVG controls use vector-style painting while retaining the same UI tree, layout, focus, and behavior foundations. NanoNode defines the painting contract; NanoContainer and concrete controls provide panels, labels, buttons, images, fields, sliders, combo boxes, links, and scrollable content.\n\nThis page summarizes 5 documented capabilities from the Valthorne wiki.",
